        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>聊天记录</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background-color: #e8e8e8;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .chat-container {\n    max-width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background-color: #e8e8e8;\n    padding: 15px 12px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .msg-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .msg-row.right {\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n  }\n  .avatar {\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 40px;\n    min-width: 40px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    background-color: #6b8caf;\n    background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, #7a9bc4 0%, #3f5f80 100%);\n    margin-right: 10px;\n  }\n  .avatar.right-avatar {\n    margin-right: 0;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n    background-image: none;\n    background-color: #d9b48f;\n  }\n  .bubble {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #333;\n    max-width: 420px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\n  }\n  .bubble.green {\n    background-color: #a5e55a;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .num-circle {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    background-color: #6ec6f0;\n    color: #fff;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .bubble-text {\n    display: inline;\n  }\n  .bubble-with-num {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 40px;\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #666;\n    text-align: center;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"chat-container\">\n\n  <!-- Message 6 -->\n  <div class=\"msg-row\">\n    <div class=\"avatar\" title=\"[Photo: avatar, scenery]\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bubble\">\n      <div class=\"bubble-with-num\">\n        <span class=\"num-circle\">6</span>\n        <span class=\"bubble-text\">这个精读的过程可能要重复几遍，好的文献不是读一遍就完事，每读一遍你都会获取新的信息。读第二第三遍的时候，在电脑打开word，开始一遍读一边记录要写进你文献综述的部分，注意要用自己的话重述。</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Message 7 -->\n  <div class=\"msg-row\">\n    <div class=\"avatar\" title=\"[Photo: avatar, scenery]\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bubble\">\n      <div class=\"bubble-with-num\">\n        <span class=\"num-circle\">7</span>\n        <span class=\"bubble-text\">最后将所有文献进行整理引用，把同一小主题的贴在同一段中，也可以加上小标题，使自己的文章更有逻辑，条理更清晰</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Message 8 -->\n  <div class=\"msg-row\">\n    <div class=\"avatar\" title=\"[Photo: avatar, scenery]\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bubble\">\n      <div class=\"bubble-with-num\">\n        <span class=\"num-circle\">8</span>\n        <span class=\"bubble-text\">尽量找出不同论文中矛盾冲突的点，凸显出学术圈思维碰撞的火花，学会用however,onthecontrary,in contrast这类连接词。</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Message: 你重新写吧 -->\n  <div class=\"msg-row\">\n    <div class=\"avatar\" title=\"[Photo: avatar, scenery]\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bubble\">\n      <span class=\"bubble-text\">你重新写吧</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Message: 好的，谢谢老师 (sent) -->\n  <div class=\"msg-row right\">\n    <div class=\"bubble green\">\n      <span class=\"bubble-text\">好的，谢谢老师</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"avatar right-avatar placeholder\" title=\"[Photo: avatar, person]\">[Avatar]</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
